 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{1CCB126808839C85}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "Recon indicates enemy consists of a mechanised infantry squad garrisoned at the local chuch overlooking the village of Arleville."\
     "HQ has advised that they are equipped with small-arms such as AK-74s, RPKs, RPGs, and supported by 1 BTR-70. HQ believes they will utilize the nearby cliffs in the defence of the village while the BTR covers the open ground to the north."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "1 platoon (us) is located on the coast of Arland east of Arleville. Coy HQ has issued an order to advance and seize the church in preperation for further operations deeper into Arland. There are no known friendly forces currently on the island. There are no reinforcements expected."\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain:"\
     "The Terrain is mixed environments with open fields to the north of the objective and small woods to the east and south. The sourthern approach is also dominated by coastal cliffs with the occational opening to the high ground."\
     ""\
     "d. Weather:"\
     "Weather is cloudy but calm. Time is 0515 LT. Light conditions are expected become significantly brighter in the next half hour."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8FD19860816B56B0}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "a. Enemy Forces:"\
     "A British platoon has landed east of Arleville in order to seize the church in preparation of an invasion of Alrand. "\
     "They have L1A1 SLRs, L7 GPMGs for small arms, as well M72 anti-tank weapons."\
     ""\
     "b. Friendly Forces:"\
     "2nd Plt 4 Coy 2 Sqd (us) is located south of Arleville, at grid (029,015). "\
     "We are to defend Arleville church, at grid (030,015), until forces to our north are able to mobilise. We have our BTR-70 and have been reinforced with the PK section. There is also a UAZ situated near the church at grid (030,015)."\
     "4 Coy HQ and 3 Coy is situated at the airport in the north west of Arland they are currently unable to assist us."\
     ""\
     "c. Terrain:"\
     "Varied terrain with open fields to the north of the chruch, forests to the east and south. The south east coast has large cliffs and are off limits after the \"Yuri incident\"."\
     ""\
     "d. Weather:"\
     "Cloudy. Time is 0515 and sunrise is expected soon."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "USSR"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{804E92D5C5589C23}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "TvT 40 Rocky Start"
     m_sContent "2:1 Attack and Defend on Arland."\
     ""\
     "British rifle platoon attempts to take key terrain. A USSR mechanised squad with MG and BTR support attempts to defend."
